    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d578">

                <pb facs="0738" n="646" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg646"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/9751</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Minister of Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Goto</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1918-04-30T10:27:00-04:00"
                            notBefore="1918-04-29T21:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April
                            30, 1918, 10.27 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Charged with the direction of Foreign Affairs, in this Ministry, owing to the
                    regrettable illness and retirement of Viscount Motono, I need hardly assure you of as firm a determination as
                    ever of this Government to promote and cement in every possible way the
                    relations <pb facs="0739" n="647" xml:id="pg647"/> of mutual regard and
                    confidence between our two nations, holding implicit faith in the final victory
                    of our common cause to which we are unalterably committed. I am indeed proud of
                    the privilege that is afforded me of associating myself with you in the great
                    task before us.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Goto</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
